WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:01.470
- Welcome back, y'all.

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:02.550
We are here with the cast

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:04.590
of "God's Favorite Idiot" on Netflix,

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:07.308
Melissa McCarthy, Ben
Falcone, Leslie Bibb,

00:00:07.308 --> 00:00:08.385
and Kevin Dunn.

00:00:08.385 --> 00:00:09.698
(audience applauds)

00:00:09.698 --> 00:00:12.120
So this is a group of
passionate and creative people.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.430
So we thought it would
be a good time to talk

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:16.410
about the things we love most in life.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:18.690
Some of which might be a
little weirder than others.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:19.523
That's right.

00:00:19.523 --> 00:00:23.319
It's time to come clean
about our obsessions.

00:00:23.319 --> 00:00:25.908
(jazz music)

00:00:25.908 --> 00:00:28.908
(audience applauds)

00:00:31.137 --> 00:00:32.529
All right.

00:00:32.529 --> 00:00:35.398
Yep. It's time once again
to own our obsessions.

00:00:35.398 --> 00:00:37.410
I've been so embarrassed
by this game on this show.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:38.460
I don't get embarrassed,

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:39.960
but I feel like I should be.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:41.868
My Dorito thing didn't go over well.

00:00:41.868 --> 00:00:42.780
- Well, you do like Cheeto fluff

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:43.800
or something you like.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:44.633
- Oh my God.

00:00:44.633 --> 00:00:46.025
Okay. Here's the thing.

00:00:46.025 --> 00:00:46.890
- Is it the dust?

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:49.050
- I don't like Doritos the chips.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:50.432
- [Leslie] Oh yeah.

00:00:50.432 --> 00:00:53.412
- Sorry. But I love
licking the cheese off.

00:00:53.412 --> 00:00:55.500
(audience laughs)

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.503
And my tongue will feel
like, you know, like a cat's.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:01.650
- Sandpaper!

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:04.020
- I really, it's one of my weird things

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:06.360
and I got shamed for it on this show.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:07.530
- That's wonderful.

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:08.460
- It's weird.

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:09.900
But I don't like the chip.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.300
I don't like how the chip
tastes or like either,

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:13.410
but I love the cheese.

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:14.616
I don't know.

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:16.673
- I have such a visual of you like.

00:01:16.673 --> 00:01:18.513
(audience laughs)

00:01:18.513 --> 00:01:20.763
- I literally have a separate bag.

